# GitHub's language bar counts only languages typed `programming` or `markup` in
# Linguist's languages.yml. SQL is typed `data`, so ~3,000 lines of it were excluded and
# the repo displayed as 100% Python on the strength of one data-generation script.
# `linguist-detectable` includes a language in the stats regardless of its type.
*.sql linguist-detectable=true

# generate_data.py produces the synthetic fixture; it is not the subject of this repo.
# Left detectable rather than hidden - it is real code and the README points at it - but
# it should not be the only thing counted.
